{"seq":1,"slug":"onshore-wind-systems","title":"陆上风电系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/onshore-wind-systems","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"陆上风电系统\">陆上风电系统</h1><p>风能是人类最早利用的自然能源之一，而现代陆上风电已从 20 世纪 80 年代丹麦的 55kW 原型机发展为单机容量超 8MW 的工业级发电系统。2025 年全球风电累计装机达 1291 GW，其中陆上风电占比约 93%，年新增 158.7 GW 创历史纪录。中国以 119.4 GW 的年新增量主导全球陆上风电增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"风能捕获原理\">风能捕获原理</h3><p>风力机从来风中提取动能，其物理基础遵循动量定理。流经风轮扫掠面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的空气质量流量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{m} = \\rho A v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，可提取的最大功率由 Betz 极限给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.593</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{max} = \\frac{16}{27} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\rho A v^3 \\approx 0.593 \\cdot P_{wind}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.593</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即理论最大风能利用系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>27</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>59.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p = 16/27 \\approx 59.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16/27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">59.3%</span></span></span></span></span>。实际商用风机的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 45-52% 之间，已接近物理极限的 80-88%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[来风动能] --&gt; B[叶片气动力做功]&#10;    B --&gt; C[低速轴旋转 10-20 rpm]&#10;    C --&gt; D{传动方案}&#10;    D --&gt;|齿轮箱| E[高速轴 1200-1800 rpm]&#10;    D --&gt;|直驱| F[低速永磁发电机]&#10;    E --&gt; G[双馈异步发电机 DFIG]&#10;    F --&gt; H[全功率变流器]&#10;    G --&gt; I[变流器]&#10;    H --&gt; J[升压并网]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[来风动能] --&gt; B[叶片气动力做功]\n    B --&gt; C[低速轴旋转 10-20 rpm]\n    C --&gt; D{传动方案}\n    D --&gt;|齿轮箱| E[高速轴 1200-1800 rpm]\n    D --&gt;|直驱| F[低速永磁发电机]\n    E --&gt; G[双馈异步发电机 DFIG]\n    F --&gt; H[全功率变流器]\n    G --&gt; I[变流器]\n    H --&gt; J[升压并网]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><h3 id=\"风能核心公式\">风能核心公式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>公式/定义</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>风功率密度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P/A = \\frac{1}{2}\\rho v^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与风速三次方成正比，选址决定性因素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Betz 极限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{p,max} = 16/27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16/27</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单风轮理论最大效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶尖速比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ω</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\omega R / v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最优值 6-9，控制系统核心参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量因子</td>\n<td>CF = 实际发电量/理论最大发电量</td>\n<td>陆上典型 25-35%，优秀 &gt;40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切入/切出风速</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通常 3 m/s / 25 m/s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变桨变速控制策略\">变桨变速控制策略</h2><p>现代大型风机采用变桨变速（Variable Speed Variable Pitch, VSVP）控制，在全风速范围内实现最优功率提取与载荷管理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"运行区间划分\">运行区间划分</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区间</th>\n<th>风速范围</th>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>执行手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>区间 I</td>\n<td>低于切入风速</td>\n<td>停机待命</td>\n<td>叶片全顺桨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间 II</td>\n<td>切入~额定风速</td>\n<td>最大功率追踪（MPPT）</td>\n<td>转速跟踪最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间 III</td>\n<td>额定~切出风速</td>\n<td>恒功率输出</td>\n<td>变桨控制限功率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间 IV</td>\n<td>超过切出风速</td>\n<td>安全停机</td>\n<td>紧急顺桨 + 偏航保护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在区间 II，控制器通过调整发电机转矩跟踪最优叶尖速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 维持在最大值。当风速超过额定风速进入区间 III，变桨系统将叶片向顺桨方向旋转，减少气动攻角以限制功率在额定值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"先进控制技术\">先进控制技术</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>独立变桨控制（IPC）</strong>：三支叶片独立变桨，消减因风剪切和塔影引起的周期性载荷</li>\n<li><strong>激光雷达前馈（LiDAR）</strong>：提前感知来风变化，减少控制系统响应延迟</li>\n<li><strong>尾流控制</strong>：上游机组偏航 2-5° 偏离来风方向，减少下游机组尾流影响，风场整体发电量提升 2-5%</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"大型化趋势与全球格局\">大型化趋势与全球格局</h2><h3 id=\"机组容量跃升\">机组容量跃升</h3><p>陆上风机单机容量的增长遵循稳定的技术学习曲线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时代</th>\n<th>主流单机容量</th>\n<th>叶轮直径</th>\n<th>塔筒高度</th>\n<th>扫掠面积</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2005-2010</td>\n<td>1.5-2.0 MW</td>\n<td>70-90m</td>\n<td>65-80m</td>\n<td>3800-6400 m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2011-2015</td>\n<td>2.0-3.0 MW</td>\n<td>90-120m</td>\n<td>80-100m</td>\n<td>6400-11300 m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2016-2020</td>\n<td>3.0-5.0 MW</td>\n<td>120-160m</td>\n<td>100-120m</td>\n<td>11300-20100 m²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2021-2025</td>\n<td>5.0-8.0 MW</td>\n<td>160-200m</td>\n<td>120-160m</td>\n<td>20100-31400 m²</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国明阳智能、金风科技、远景能源等已推出 8-10MW 级陆上机组。更大的扫掠面积意味着更低的切入风速和更高的容量因子，使中低风速地区（年平均风速 5-6 m/s）也具备经济性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全球装机格局-2025-年底\">全球装机格局（2025 年底）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>国家/地区</th>\n<th>陆上风电累计装机</th>\n<th>年新增</th>\n<th>全球占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>&gt;450 GW</td>\n<td>119.4 GW</td>\n<td>~38%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>~155 GW</td>\n<td>~12 GW</td>\n<td>~13%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德国</td>\n<td>~73 GW</td>\n<td>~6 GW</td>\n<td>~6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>~50 GW</td>\n<td>6.3 GW</td>\n<td>~4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴西</td>\n<td>~30 GW</td>\n<td>~5 GW</td>\n<td>~3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球合计</td>\n<td>~1200 GW</td>\n<td>~145 GW</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国 2025 年单年陆上风电新增约 119.4 GW，超过全球其他所有国家之和，体现了规模化制造降本和&quot;沙戈荒&quot;大基地政策的强力拉动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选址与并网挑战\">选址与并网挑战</h2><h3 id=\"风资源评估\">风资源评估</h3><p>风电选址的核心是风资源评估。典型流程包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>宏观选址</strong>：基于再分析数据（ERA5）和中尺度模型筛选风功率密度 &gt;300 W/m² 的区域</li>\n<li><strong>测风塔实测</strong>：安装 80-120m 测风塔，连续采集 1-2 年风速风向数据</li>\n<li><strong>微观选址</strong>：CFD 或 WAsP 建模优化机位布局，考虑地形加速效应与尾流损失</li>\n<li><strong>不确定性分析</strong>：P50/P75/P90 发电量概率评估，满足银行融资要求</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"电网消纳\">电网消纳</h3><p>高比例风电并网面临的核心挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>波动性</strong>：风电出力变化率大，需配套调峰资源（火电灵活性改造、储能、需求响应）</li>\n<li><strong>无功支撑</strong>：全功率变流器可提供电压支撑，但缺乏同步惯量</li>\n<li><strong>送出受限</strong>：中国&quot;三北&quot;地区风电送出受特高压通道容量约束，弃风率仍在 3-5%</li>\n<li><strong>市场化交易</strong>：2025 年中国全面实施新能源参与电力现货市场，风电需承担偏差考核</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风能提取受 Betz 极限约束，理论最大风能利用系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>27</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>59.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p = 16/27 \\approx 59.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16/27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">59.3%</span></span></span></span></span>，商用风机实际为 45-52%，已达物理极限的 80-88%。</li>\n<li>风功率密度与风速三次方成正比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P/A = \\frac{1}{2}\\rho v^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），风速增加 10% 即带来约 33% 的功率增益，因此微观选址精度直接决定项目收益。</li>\n<li>变桨变速控制按运行区间管理功率与载荷：区间 II 追踪最优叶尖速比最大化发电，区间 III 变桨限功率，IPC 与 LiDAR 前馈进一步提效降载。</li>\n<li>大型化是稳定趋势，主流单机容量从 1.5-2.0MW 跃升至 5.0-8.0MW，更大扫掠面积带来更低切入风速与更高容量因子，使中低风速地区也具备经济性。</li>\n<li>并网消纳仍是主要约束：中国「三北」地区受特高压通道容量限制存在 3-5% 弃风率，新能源全面参与现货市场后风电还需承担偏差考核。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"参考框架\">参考框架</h2><p><strong>理解陆上风电的核心分析维度：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>功率与风速三次方关系</strong>：风速增加 10% → 功率增加 33%，微观选址精度直接决定项目收益</li>\n<li><strong>大型化降本逻辑</strong>：更大扫掠面积 → 更高容量因子 → 每 kWh 固定成本摊薄</li>\n<li><strong>全生命周期度电成本（LCOE）</strong>：陆上风电 2025 年全球平均约 $0.03-0.05/kWh，与光伏并列最低成本电源</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;三北&quot;大基地模式</strong>：中国在内蒙古、甘肃、新疆集中建设的风光大基地配套特高压外送和调峰储能</li>\n<li><strong>数据来源</strong>：GWEC Global Wind Report、IRENA Renewable Capacity Statistics 2026、中国能源局统计数据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"陆上风电系统","id":"陆上风电系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"风能捕获原理","id":"风能捕获原理"},{"level":3,"text":"风能核心公式","id":"风能核心公式"},{"level":2,"text":"变桨变速控制策略","id":"变桨变速控制策略"},{"level":3,"text":"运行区间划分","id":"运行区间划分"},{"level":3,"text":"先进控制技术","id":"先进控制技术"},{"level":2,"text":"大型化趋势与全球格局","id":"大型化趋势与全球格局"},{"level":3,"text":"机组容量跃升","id":"机组容量跃升"},{"level":3,"text":"全球装机格局（2025 年底）","id":"全球装机格局-2025-年底"},{"level":2,"text":"选址与并网挑战","id":"选址与并网挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"风资源评估","id":"风资源评估"},{"level":3,"text":"电网消纳","id":"电网消纳"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考框架","id":"参考框架"}],"prev":{"title":"聚光太阳能与光热储能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/concentrated-solar-storage"},"next":{"title":"海上与漂浮式风电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/offshore-floating-wind"}}